From 853d6a2aa1a7f68777679e4725a5f5a010bf37c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Quick=20=E2=9A=A1?= <quick@disroot.org>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:56:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Allow disabling ReVanced mods

Adds the ReVanced integration switch to Apps. Turning it on uninstalls
YouTube/YT Music updates first, then sets persist.sys.revan.mod and
reboots so the patched APKs are bind-mounted over the stock ones (see
vendor/revanced); turning it off clears the property and reboots.

Adapted for PenguinOS from Inventor365/packages_apps_Settings-lunaris
16.2: f6c19c0736e4 ("Allow disabling ReVanced mods [2/2]"),
63dc5614f7fe ("Optimize ReVanced toggle") and a1508e8f10dd ("Fix
ReVanced toggle restore ordering"), squashed to their final state. Only
the ReVanced strings are carried, in their own file; the unrelated
LumineDroid strings and the GameSpace entry from the first commit are
left out.

Change-Id: I40b593b1b16ef687086e6b5a1586bfe22057fa16
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
